---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="From zero code to 4,100 commits in 12 months. The full story.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <h1 class="mb-8 font-heading text-4xl font-bold md:text-5xl">About</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-3xl text-text-secondary">
      <p class="text-lg">
        I started coding on May 29, 2025. No CS degree, no bootcamp, no technical background.
        Just WordPress, Divi, and a dream of building a rental platform.
      </p>

      <p>
        Twelve months later: 4,100+ commits, 36+ repos, CRMs in production,
        lead scoring engines, WhatsApp integrations, and a published open source package.
        I'm the de facto tech lead at Capital Inteligente, building products across
        real estate, investment, and education.
      </p>

      <p>
        I don't come from the traditional path. That's exactly what lets me build different.
        I see business problems first, technology second. I orchestrate AI agents
        (Claude Code, Cursor, Codex) with engineering discipline — conventional commits,
        ADRs, CI/CD, automated documentation. Not code-and-pray. Engineered output.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text">Stack</h2>
      <p>
        Next.js, React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Supabase, Astro, WhatsApp Cloud API,
        GSAP, Vercel, GitHub Actions, Vitest.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text">What I build</h2>
      <p>
        CRMs, admin dashboards, lead scoring engines, WhatsApp automation,
        real estate platforms, and the internal tools that make teams faster.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text">Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        <a href="mailto:elkis@elkis.dev" class="text-accent hover:underline">elkis@elkis.dev</a>
        &middot;
        <a href="https://github.com/elkisdm" class="text-accent hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        &middot;
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/elkisdm" class="text-accent hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
